<title>USA: U.S. barge rates - Quoted at thin levels.</title>
<headline>U.S. barge rates - Quoted at thin levels.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. barge rates were quoted at thin levels Friday on the St. Louis Merchants Exchange call session.</p>
<p>Four barges traded versus none Thursday.</p>
<p>Trades, bids and offers included:</p>
<p>- Four barges, Illinois River, one each week of July, traded at 105 percent of tariff.</p>
<p>- Two barges, Illinois, bid 100 percent, one barge offered at 105 percent.  </p>
<p>- One barge, Mid-Mississippi River, next week, bid 110 percent, no offer.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
